    "growth_divergence_warning": "All 3- and 5-year CAGRs are distorted by the FY2020-22 COVID-testing windfall (revenue peaked $10.8B FY2021, fell to $9.3B FY2023). Equity 5yr CAGR 1.1% vs EPS -3.5% and revenue 3.2% (>30% divergence) - buybacks of $3.6B in FY2021-22 depressed book value. The pre-COVID-anchored 2019-2025 window is the meaningful comparison.",
