    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. 10y UST ~4.3%, beta ~0.65 (defensive healthcare services), ERP 5.0% -> cost of equity ~7.6%; pre-tax cost of debt ~5.3% (~4.1% after tax); market-value weights ~84% equity (~$26.5B cap) / 16% debt ($5.65B) -> ~7.0%. Rounded up to 7.5% for reimbursement/regulatory concentration (Medicare CLFS/PAMA). Same WACC in all three scenarios: risk is carried by the scenario weights, not stacked in the rate.",
    "lease_treatment": "US GAAP ASC 842: operating lease cost sits inside operating expenses, so EBITDA is already post-lease; operating lease liabilities are therefore EXCLUDED from net debt (one treatment). Finance leases are within total debt.",
